# Echo Kirche — Agent & Cursor Guidelines

All AI coding assistants (ChatGPT, Cursor, Windsurf, Claude, Copilot, Antigravity) must strictly follow these project rules:

## 1. Official Echo Kirche Styleguide

### 1.1 Spacing & Logo Clear Space (*Schutzzone*)
- **Logo Clear Space:** Minimum buffer equal to the **height/width of lowercase letter "e"** from the *echo* wordmark on all four sides. No text, buttons, borders, or graphics may enter this zone.
- **Logo Integrity:** Never stretch, compress, rotate, distort, or alter proportions.

### 1.2 Typography, Sizes & Hierarchy
- **Headings & Logo:** `Clash Display` — Semibold (600) for headings & the word *echo*; Regular (400) for sub-brand qualifiers (such as *kids* in *echo kids*).
- **Body, Buttons & Links:** `Inter` — Regular (400).
- **Optional Digital Accent Fonts:** `Perandory Condensed` (headlines) and `Sloop Script Pro` (script accents/subheadings).
- **Type Scale & Usage:**
  - H1: 48px (Main page title)
  - H2: 40px (Major section headers)
  - H3: 32px (Subsections)
  - H4: 24px (Profile title / sub-brand header)
  - H5: 20px (Cards, panels, and link buttons)
  - H6: 18px (Small headings)
  - Body Large: 18px (Bio intro text or large body copy)
  - Body: 16px (Standard bio/description text)
  - Body Small: 14px (Secondary link descriptions)
  - Caption: 12px (Image captions / footer notes)
  - Overline / Label: 10px–11px (Tags, badges, category labels)

### 1.3 Colors & Contrast Rules
- **Page Background:** Light Pastel Yellow (`#FEFADC`) for soft backgrounds. Full-bleed backgrounds can also use Muted Lavender (`#846B8A`) or Dark Teal Blue (`#08415C`) with inverted white (`#FFFFFF`) or `#FEFADC` text/logos.
- **Primary Text & Dark Accents / Buttons:** Dark Teal Blue (`#08415C`).
- **Secondary Accents / Hover States:** Muted Lavender (`#846B8A`).
- **Brand Color Constancy:** Colors must **never** change based on URL parameters or surfaces.

### 1.4 Images & Media Specs (Avatars / Banners)
- **Format & Size:** `.webp` only, **maximum 400 KB**.
- **Max Widths:** 1900px for heroes, 1400px for standard images. Aspect ratios: `3:2`, `4:3`, `16:9` (and `3:4`).
- **Subject Matter:** Authentic photos of people, community, faces, and visible emotions.

### 1.5 Unspecified CSS Properties (Clean Web Defaults)
- Line-height: `1.4–1.5` body, `1.1–1.2` headings.
- Container: Centered `~600px` (or `~42rem`) max-width.
- Radius: `4px` (small), `8px` (medium), `16px` (large), `999px` (pill).
- Shadows: Subtle, prioritizing borders and clean whitespace.

## 2. Technical Invariants
- Static-first with Eleventy (11ty) and Nunjucks templates.
- Compile Sass (`src/styles/main.scss`) to `_site/css/main.css`.
- Headless CMS with Storyblok (`storyblok/components.json` + `src/_data/site.json`).
- Zero JS framework hydration; pure CSS for collapsible cards (`<details>` / `<summary>`).
- Strict GDPR compliance: no third-party cookies on initial page visit.
- Verification: `npm run build` and `npm test` must always pass.
